1 REM FBCS ARR-0211
2 REM CLAIM D-5.2-1
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 REM MAT WRITE OF ELEMENTS NEVER ASSIGNED WRITES THE VALUE 0 (A NUMBER, NOT AN EMPTY ITEM) AND RAISES 3101
105 REM THE VALUES READ BACK ARE THE NUMBER 0 (5.2.4, 11.3.4.10, 11.3.4.12)
107 REM NO USER HANDLER HANDLES THE EXCEPTION, SO THE DEFAULT RECOVERY APPLIES (4.1 L.1360-1368)
110 OPEN #1: NAME "ARR0211.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE INTERNAL
120 DIM M(2)
150 MAT WRITE #1: M
200 SET #1: POINTER BEGIN
210 READ #1: A, B
220 IF A = 0 AND B = 0 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED: "; A; B
230 END
